            <description><![CDATA[<h2>A little more room to play</h2>
<p>Perch now has 20 widgets, including Color picker, QR code, Text tools, Quick decisions, Doodle, and Tiny garden.</p>
<p>Relax adds five-minute guided breathwork, quiet sessions, four optional ambient sounds, and optional spoken guidance.</p>
<p>The widget picker puts daily tools first. Short dock labels keep titles readable, and custom orders stay intact.</p>
<p>Download a disk image and check for future updates inside Perch. Updates save your work and create a verified local data backup.</p>
<p>This release also fixes a freeze caused by background macOS day-change notifications.</p>
]]></description>
